  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"Zach Aller\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-10-26T08:22:18-05:00",
        "subject": "fix(rac): delete a RestoreActiveCommit whose tip is already unblocked (#2290)",
        "body": "* fix(rac): delete a RestoreActiveCommit whose tip is already unblocked\n\nA policy can adopt a restore after the previous object stamped Promoter-restore-unblocked-at and deleted itself. RestoreActiveBranch refuses that tip, so the new object never records status and blocks promotion. Delete it and leave the existing stamp in place.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test: wait out a transient adopted RestoreActiveCommit after unblock\n\nDocument RestoreAlreadyReleased. The unblock spec no longer fails when a ChangeTransferPolicy adopts an object from a stale notes snapshot; that object deletes itself, and the spec waits until the list stays empty.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* codegen\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "sha": "28039beb11f4dced2ef7f2992afab7c979e65425",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
